  "body": "This PR:\n - Removes the XXX box mentioned in #2688 since we now create Documents after Windows in the spec\n - Fixes #2455 by doing the following:\n    - Makes [#set-up-a-window-environment-settings-object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/window-object.html#set-up-a-window-environment-settings-object) take a _creationURL_ parameter, which is used to set the created setting's object's creationURL.\n    - We also modify the #set-up-a-window-environment-settings-object call sites accordingly. The [#creating-a-new-browsing-context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#creating-a-new-browsing-context) call site explicitly passes in \"about:blank\" as the _creationURL_, where as the [create and initialize a document object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#initialise-the-document-object) call site passes in _creationURL_, which is the same URL that is assigned to the newly-created document later\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6191/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 3, 2020, 5:58 PM UTC (6f8cc5c)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6191/65b2af5...6f8cc5c/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 3, 2020, 5:58 PM UTC (6f8cc5c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6191/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 3, 2020, 5:58 PM UTC (6f8cc5c)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6191/65b2af5...6f8cc5c/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 3, 2020, 5:58 PM UTC (6f8cc5c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6191/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 3, 2020, 5:58 PM UTC (6f8cc5c)\">/window-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6191/65b2af5...6f8cc5c/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 3, 2020, 5:58 PM UTC (6f8cc5c)\">diff</a> )",
